  "description": "T1 - Weeping Willow - pollard, down to 6-7m from ground level\r\nThis work is proposed to remove branch weight and extension from a steeply leaning tree that overhangs the canal towpath. A large decayed cavity is present at 2m from ground level. There are various historic pruning points at various levels throughout the trees crown. The work is proposed to prevent limb or tree failure and prolong the life span of this valuable tree",
